The maintainers have not decided on a licence for FROLIC. Until a licence
is added here, all rights are reserved and the code may not be redistributed.

See THIRD_PARTY.md for the licences of the models and libraries this
pipeline depends on; several of them (SAM 3D Body, the research-only training
data behind the detector and re-ID weights) restrict redistribution or
commercial use and constrain the choice made here. THIRD_PARTY.md ends with a
recommendation (Apache-2.0 for the code, with the model restrictions documented).
